{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/181423-dtf-style-pacts","id":181423,"title":"DtF style Pacts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-26T17:07:52-07:00","id":181423,"title":"DtF style Pacts","content":"So I'm still referencing the Kickstarter document, apologies if this is addressed in the full game. The only thing that feels flat to me about Demon is the pact system, and even then not all the way. I LOVE how the pacts work, as rearranging the universe for the pact to work. I love the idea of grabbing bits and fragments of lives, getting servants, etc. I miss using Pacts for power like in Fallen. I know that Descent demons get power from Infrastructure. Would it be thematically ok for possibly a lesser, impure, or less good form of fuel to come from humans in a pact? There would have to be some kind of lifetime limit per person, I guess...I dunno, I miss that part. Anyone done anything with this?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Just want to be clear, I am planning on buying the game ASAP. Money has been tight lately, but I want to make sure people don't think I'm freeloading off the Kickstarter document.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":961,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","user":"ChewyGranola","date":". 06-27-2014, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T22:09:50-07:00","id":181661,"title":"","content":"I actually had the idea that the reason you get folks that can see the cogs and so on, with psychic powers etc, is because they get a bit broken, tainted even, inside. They shove up against the machine, or get shoved next to it, and it rubs off. So maybe a demon could, with a pact, arrange to get some tiny amount of aether off of these gifted people? You could make it an aether per week, or perhaps a dot per chapter/session (whatever fits the campaign style).<br /> <br /> Another possible twist is to set up an embed which has a single purpose, to change a human in such a way that they produce, and burn, a tiny amount of essence, resulting in an aether buildup within them (or around them?). They'd probably be pretty visible to angels and sensors (well, depending on the game), but could make for a reliable source of aether that isn't already crawling with monitors and enemies. It could easily be part of a pact to let the demon harvest that.<br /> <br /> Heck, in the end you could just declare that pacts seem to work a bit like infrastructure of a kind, they get essence (presumably), burn it and produce minute amounts of aether, and perhaps the right kind of pact can &quot;ramp up&quot; that sort of process, actually feed into it as much as possible, to turn the human into a sort of walking battery.<br /> <br /> Anyways, those are my first thoughts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","name":"Asaram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T23:05:57-07:00","id":181682,"title":"","content":"Maybe you treat that new merit from <i>Flowers of Hell </i>called Potent Blood as a supernatural merit. Y'know, Stigmatics with trace amounts of Aether in their blood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T13:36:13-07:00","id":182185,"title":"","content":"So possible having the idea of getting Aether be a one time deal? Like, sign this pact, I get some Aether from you when I need it, but only once?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}